id=fusion_controller
name=Fusion Controller
version=v2.1.8
versionCode=28
author=fusiond
description=Merges every connected gamepad (built-in + Bluetooth/USB) into one virtual "Fusion Controller" that all apps can use. Press a button on any pad and the Fusion pad sends it. Sources stay visible by default (HIDE=1 hides them). Config: /data/adb/fusion.conf - Log: /data/adb/fusion.log